and I noticed in the code that there are shopkeeper names provided for
about 30 dlevels of each type of shop (shopkeepers of each shop type
are of the same nationality, or of one of several.  Kinda neat.  E.g.,
French-named shopkeepers for antique weapons outlets, Irish for books,
Welsh and Scottish for wands, etc.).
I'm sure there's a decreasing probability of finding a shop the deeper
you are, though I didn't try to find the code for that.  But I've
*never* gotten one deep down.  What's the deepest other people
have found one?  Did it have better stuff in it?

